Stopped the deprecated cable lookups in the IP Fabric integration failing `invoke pylint` on Nautobot 3.2. `pylint-nautobot` 1.1.0 added `nb-deprecated-cable-lookup`, which flags the Nautobot 3.0 and 3.1 arm of a version check where `cable_termination` does not exist. The warning is suppressed on that one line until those versions are no longer served, in a form that also passes on Nautobot 3.1, whose `pylint-nautobot` does not have that checker to name.
